cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these skills in your work, please cite this repository. Please also cite the underlying datasets (eICU-CRD, MIMIC-IV) per their PhysioNet requirements."
title: "icu_analysis_skills: Claude Code skills for ML analysis of ICU EHR datasets"
abstract: >-
  A set of Claude Code skills describing how to identify patient cohorts, locate
  clinical variables, and engineer time-windowed features in critical-care EHR
  datasets (eICU-CRD, MIMIC-IV, and institutional Epic Clarity exports) for
  machine-learning and statistical analysis.
type: software
